   "content": {
    "text": "Why has China's balance of payments goods surplus diverged so sharply from its customs goods surplus since 2022, and which measure should be trusted?",
    "label": null,
    "explicit": false,
    "reason": "When two official measures of the same flow diverge, the cause of the gap determines which one to use."
