      "relation": "states",
      "link_method": "llm_citation",
      "anchor_grade": "excerpt",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "source_excerpt": "In order to capture exports and imports of goods that do not physically cross the border comprehensively, the Chinese BOP compilers switched the data sources from Customs data to direct reporting of financial records by large enterprises in 2022."
